# variants/kits/internet/web — ONE browser, by decision (2026-09-09).
#
# chromium, firefox and librewolf were dropped: four browsers in every image is
# three too many, and each carries its own multi-hour build. brave-browser is a
# BINARY package from ::bentoo, so it costs download only -- no compile at all.
#
# Catalog-only (2026-10-01): firefox and firefox-bin, for whoever wants them,
# and net-libs/webkit-gtk -- NOT a browser but the engine GTK applications
# embed, so an image gets it as a dependency when one needs it. Both slots are
# listed so the binhost builds each (4.1 and 6), not only the newest.
#
# LEAF set: a flat list of atoms (2026-09-09). See kits/core/base for the layering contract.

